{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入境處打擊非法勞工，拘捕13人包括一名僱主。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入境處上周五至昨日，聯同食環署、警方等，搜查全港多間餐廳、建築地盤等，拘捕9男3女懷疑非法勞工，介乎33至60歲，其中三人持「行街紙」。行動亦拘捕一名38歲男子，涉嫌聘請非法勞工。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WORKER-1630_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026F7K5kH7tun1790325828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WORKER-1630_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入境處指僱用非法勞工是嚴重罪行，最高可罰款50萬元及監禁十年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T08:59:26.740382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}